# =====================================================
# SMTP Configuration (Spring JavaMailSender)
# =====================================================
# Gmail SMTP uses your Gmail address and a dedicated 16-character Google App Password.
# 1. Ensure 2-Step Verification is active on your Google Account.
# 2. Visit: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create a new App Password (e.g. named "DZAVO Website").
# 4. Copy the generated 16-character code into SMTP_PASSWORD below.
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=dilliprasath1225@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=
MAIL_FROM=DZAVO Technology <dilliprasath1225@gmail.com>
